A boat travels 24 km downstream in 2 hours and 24 km upstream in 3 hours. What is the speed of the boat in still water?

A) 8 km/h
B) 10 km/h
C) 12 km/h
D) 14 km/h

Answer: B) 10 km/h

Explanation:

Downstream speed:

$$ \frac{24}{2}=12\text{ km/h} $$

Upstream speed:

$$ \frac{24}{3}=8\text{ km/h} $$

Speed of boat in still water:

2
12+8
	​

=
2
20
	​

=
10 km/h
